# Three-dimensional FeMZn (M = Co or Ni) MOFs: Ions coordinated self-assembling processes and boosting microwave absorption

Three-dimensional FeMZn $\mathbf{\tilde{M}}=\mathbf{\tilde{C}}\mathbf{0}$ or Ni) MOFs: Ions coordinated self-assembling processes and boosting microwave absorption
